  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La police d’Illumis compte beaucoup sur l’aide\ndes Pokémon pour mener ses enquêtes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne déroge pas à cette règle ; c’est pourquoi\nj’aimerais réquisitionner l’aide d’un Polichombr.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Polichombr se délectent des émotions\nnégatives comme la jalousie ou la rancune.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela fait d’eux d’excellents radars pour\ndétecter les personnes mal intentionnées.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous pourrions alors intervenir avant même\nqu’un crime ne soit commis.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veux-tu bien m’aider et me donner\nun Polichombr, si tu en as un ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006500750078002D007400750020006200690065006E0020006D2019006100690064006500720020006500740020006D006500200064006F006E006E00650072000A0075006E00200050006F006C006900630068006F006D00620072002C00200073006900200074007500200065006E00200061007300200075006E0020003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veux-tu bien me donner un Polichombr ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006500750078002D007400750020006200690065006E0020006D006500200064006F006E006E0065007200200075006E00200050006F006C006900630068006F006D006200720020003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne préfère pas...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E006500200070007200E9006600E8007200650020007000610073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci infiniment !\nQuel Polichombr acceptes-tu de me donner ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900200069006E00660069006E0069006D0065006E007400200021000A005100750065006C00200050006F006C006900630068006F006D00620072002000610063006300650070007400650073002D007400750020006400650020006D006500200064006F006E006E006500720020003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "*soupir* Il va falloir que je combatte\nle crime seul... sans aide... abandonné...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enchanté, Polichombr !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E006300680061006E007400E9002C00200050006F006C006900630068006F006D0062007200200021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La paix à Illumis repose sur tes épau... euh, ta\ncorne ? Bref, j’ai hâte de voir ce que tu sais faire !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh ben, on dirait que tu as bien mangé ta soupe !\nAvec ce gabarit, la paix est assurée à Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais chaque chose en son temps. Je n’attends\npas de toi que tu sois opérationnel tout de suite...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brrr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Il a déjà détecté des émotions négatives ?!\nVite, suivons-le !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020002100200049006C002000610020006400E9006A00E00020006400E9007400650063007400E90020006400650073002000E9006D006F00740069006F006E00730020006E00E900670061007400690076006500730020003F0021000A0056006900740065002C00200073007500690076006F006E0073002D006C006500200021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais qu’est-ce qui te prend, Polichombr ?\nC’est... c’est chez moi, ça !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brrr !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200720072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, bonsoir, chéri ! Tu es de retour du travail ?\nJ’espère que ta journée s’est bien passée.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout à fait, je suis au milieu d’une enquête...\nTu n’aurais rien vu de suspect ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, tu es là pour le travail... Je vois...\nBon courage, alors...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020007400750020006500730020006C00E000200070006F007500720020006C00650020007400720061007600610069006C002E002E002E0020004A006500200076006F00690073002E002E002E000A0042006F006E00200063006F00750072006100670065002C00200061006C006F00720073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BRRR !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200520052005200200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ? Polichombr ? Pourquoi tu...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F00200050006F006C006900630068006F006D006200720020003F00200050006F0075007200710075006F0069002000740075002E002E002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi as-tu amené ce vilain Polichombr ici ?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMoi qui faisais de mon mieux pour cacher ces\nhorribles pensées négatives qui me hantent !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein... Ne me dis pas que...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E002E002E002E0020004E00650020006D0065002000640069007300200070006100730020007100750065002E002E002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’étais tellement obsédé par mon travail\nque ça m’a aveuglé...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMa femme m’en veut terriblement, et\nje n’ai pas su voir le mal qui la ronge...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il m’aura fallu l’aide de Polichombr\npour le remarquer...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020006D20190061007500720061002000660061006C006C00750020006C2019006100690064006500200064006500200050006F006C006900630068006F006D00620072000A0070006F007500720020006C0065002000720065006D006100720071007500650072002E002E002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brrr.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200720072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Après toutes ces années passées ensemble,\nje pensais que notre relation pouvait se passer<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde communication directe...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais à avoir constamment le nez dans le travail,\nj’ai failli à mon devoir de mari, et j’ai été aveugle<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nau malheur de ma propre femme...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci pour cette prise de conscience, Polichombr.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900200070006F0075007200200063006500740074006500200070007200690073006500200064006500200063006F006E0073006300690065006E00630065002C00200050006F006C006900630068006F006D00620072002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais faire de mon mieux pour être un meilleur\nmari. Je compte sur toi pour me remettre sur<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nle droit chemin si je m’en éloigne, Polichombr !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aimerais me débarrasser de toutes ces pensées\nnégatives...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069006D006500720061006900730020006D00650020006400E900620061007200720061007300730065007200200064006500200074006F00750074006500730020006300650073002000700065006E007300E900650073000A006E00E90067006100740069007600650073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brrr.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200720072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Désolé, Polichombr, mais je vais tout faire pour\nque ma femme n’ait plus de pensées négatives.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    }
